	quest.19EF1710E8E39940.title: "Fuel Assembly"
	quest.1A62F189FFAB208D.quest_desc: [
		"Uranium ore goes through the Chemical Dissolution line to make yellow cake. Oxidize it and spin it in the Isotopic Centrifuge to make fissile fuel for the reactor."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 8 x Yellow Cake Uranium and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1A62F189FFAB208D.title: "Yellow Cake"
	quest.1AF57146258016C1.quest_desc: [
		"Mekanism Generators goes from a single heat generator all the way to fusion power. Work through it from top to bottom: each generator here makes a lot more power than the last."
		""
		"Start with a lava bucket. Heat generators love lava."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot Lava Bucket and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1AF57146258016C1.title: "Power for Mekanism"
	quest.1AF9D8E24ADBB309.quest_desc: [
		"The Industrial Turbine is a multiblock. Build a hollow box of Turbine Casings (the outside can include glass and vents), with rotors and blades up the middle, a Rotational Complex on top of the rotors, then coils and a Pressure Disperser layer."
		""
		"Feed it steam from a boiler or fission reactor and it turns into huge amounts of power."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Turbine Casing and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1AF9D8E24ADBB309.title: "Industrial Turbine"
	quest.1DEE0DDC1E86E55C.quest_desc: [
		"Emits redstone to SCRAM the reactor when things get hot. Build this!"
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Fission Reactor Logic Adapter and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
