	quest.56C51F07B9DA50C0.title: "Deuterium"
	quest.5CC23D03C1F1BBF2.quest_desc: [
		"Fusion is the best power in Mekanism. A 5x5x5 ring-shaped frame with ports, a laser-ignited core, and a steady supply of deuterium and tritium."
		""
		"Once lit, it keeps itself going as long as fuel flows in."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Fusion Reactor Controller and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
